# Deep Ground Training

Mobile-first football training recommender. Deterministic engine, no LLM.

## Run
npm install
npm run dev

## Test
npm run test
npm run typecheck
npm run build

## Architecture
- `lib/recommendation` — framework-independent engine
- `lib/state` — questionnaire state
- `app/` — Next.js routes
- `data/exercises.json` — 50-exercise dataset

## Env
None required for MVP.

## Deploy
Vercel: connect repo, build command `next build`.